source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A newline in the body refuses the Monospace Span in Jira, so jiro keeps the run literal in the joined paragraph.
-- input.jira --
{{a
b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{a<br/>
b}}</p>
-- want.md --
{{a b}}
-- warnings.json --
[]
